> show
  Tonight (2): m1 m2
  Later (0):
> lift m2
  drag: lifted m2 to now 1
  says: Picked up Cool the camera. Use arrow keys to move within column, Tab to move between columns, Space to drop, Escape to cancel.
> next
  asks: where a move goes from now 1: later 0
  drag: lifted m2 to later 0
  says: Moved to Later, position 1.
  asks: focus m2
> drop
  drag: idle
  says: Dropped Cool the camera in position 1 of Later.
  asks: focus m2
  asks: save the board
> add later
  form: open on later, title ""
  asks: focus the form
> type Park the scope
  form: open on later, title "Park the scope"
> submit
  asks: an id for "Park the scope" in later
  form: shut
  asks: save the board
> end
  Tonight (1): m1
  Later (2): m2 new-1
